Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:02.53,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hurray！！ Hurray！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.53,0:00:05.13,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}君と僕に向けて叫ぼう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:06.72,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Play Ball！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:20.05,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}泥だらけの過去背負って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:23.19,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}汗も涙も自信になって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:25.87,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}それだって報われない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:28.99,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}チャンスもあるんでしょう？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.50,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}努力や挫折が却って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:34.45,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}明日の足かせにならぬように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:37.79,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}満足なんてしてらんないや
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.99,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}夢がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:43.07,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}僅かな希望だとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:45.87,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}確かな鼓動鳴らして
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.74,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}走れ！イレギュラーもピンチも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.21,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}むしろ心躍るでしょう？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}もっと Hurray！！ Hurray！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:56.72,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}どこまでもこの声よ、届け！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.69,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}始まりの合図(SHOW YOUR SUN)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:03.41,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}君なりの未来はどう描くんだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:04.65,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hurray！！ Hurray！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:08.16,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}奮い立った先に待つ絶景を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.99,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}信じれば(SHOW YOUR SUN)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:13.80,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ワクワクが止まらないでしょう？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:14.81,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Play Ball！！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:02.53,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Hurray！！ Hurray！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.53,0:00:05.13,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,向著你我大聲吶喊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:06.72,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Play Ball！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:20.05,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,背負著滿身泥濘的過往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:23.19,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,汗水及淚水化成了自信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:25.87,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,就算是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:28.99,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,也會碰上徒勞無功的機會吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:31.50,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,努力和挫折有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:34.45,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,成為明日的絆腳石
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:37.79,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,但我只要夢想還在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.99,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,就不會因此而滿足
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:43.07,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,僅僅是渺小的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:45.87,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,心跳聲確實在跳動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:48.74,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,跑吧！無論是意外還是危機
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.21,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,反而更令人熱血沸騰吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,再來 Hurray！！ Hurray！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:56.72,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,這加油聲要傳遍世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.69,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,開始的信號(SHOW YOUR SUN)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:03.41,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,你要如何描繪屬於你的未來呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:04.65,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Hurray！！ Hurray！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:08.16,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,高漲情緒的前面是壯闊美景
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.99,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,去相信它吧(SHOW YOUR SUN)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:13.80,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,這令人雀躍不已吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:14.81,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Play Ball！！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.55,0:22:19.17,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}「ワン！ツー！スリー！フォー！ファイブ！」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:20.90,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}「レッツゴー！」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.59,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}シェイクシェイク！みんな揃って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:26.19,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}フレー！フレー！「フレー！フレー！」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:29.01,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ドンシェイク！こっちは振っちゃダメ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.01,0:22:31.58,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ドンシェイク！「ドンシェイク！」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.29,0:22:39.71,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(ストライク！)　コースギリギリ、狙い澄ましたインコース
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:45.03,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(ボール！)　何度でも何度でも迷う気持ち乙女心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:50.41,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(ストライク！)　黄金比3対7　笑顔が美味さの秘訣です
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:55.95,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(ボール！)　打席に立て！心の汗流せ！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:23:00.72,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(ストライク！)　よそ見しちゃダメよ　キリキリ舞いキリキリ舞い！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.05,0:23:03.92,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}暑い日も風の日も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:06.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}泣きそうな時も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.35,0:23:07.57,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}きっと　きっと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:09.29,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ここに　あるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.29,0:23:15.02,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}いつだって湧き上がる感動　響き渡る歓声
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:17.54,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(1・2・3・4！)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.27,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}シェイクシェイク！君と！プレイボール(フレー！フレー！)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:22.96,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ストライクゾーン狙って
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:25.67,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ドンシェイク！あふれちゃうから(ドンシェイク！)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:28.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}わたしの気持ち　揺さぶらないで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:31.02,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}シェイクシェイク！狙い定めて(振れー！振れー！)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:33.39,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}君は永久欠番
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.39,0:23:35.87,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ドンシェイク！今日もありがとう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:38.47,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}さあさあ　もういっちょいかが？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:41.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}おいで君も　ボールパーク
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.35,0:23:43.33,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ここで　きっとつかまえて
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.55,0:22:19.17,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,「One! Two! Three! Four! Five!」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:20.90,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,「Let's go！」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.59,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Shake Shake！大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.59,0:22:26.19,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Hurray！Hurray！「Hurray！Hurray！」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:29.01,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Don't Shake！這邊可不能揮棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.01,0:22:31.58,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Don't Shake！「Don't Shake！」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.29,0:22:39.71,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,（好球！）　緊貼邊線，精準狙擊內角球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:45.03,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,（壞球！）　無數次猶豫不決 少女心總在搖擺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:50.41,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,（好球！）　黃金比例三比七 笑容才是美味的秘訣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:55.95,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,（壞球！）　上場打擊吧！讓內心的汗水流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:23:00.72,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,（好球！）　可不能分心喔 轉呀轉地舞動起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.05,0:23:03.92,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,無論是炎熱的日子 還是風大的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:06.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,就算快要哭出來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.35,0:23:07.57,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,一定　一定
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:09.29,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,都在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.29,0:23:15.02,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,總是湧現的感動 迴盪的歡呼聲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:17.54,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,（1・2・3・4！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.27,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Shake Shake！和你一起！Play ball！（Hurray！Hurray！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:22.96,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,瞄準好球帶投球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:25.67,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Don't Shake！滿溢而出（Don't Shake！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:28.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,別再讓我的心情動搖啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:31.02,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Shake Shake！瞄準鎖定！（揮棒ー！揮棒ー！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:33.39,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,你是永遠的空號
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.39,0:23:35.87,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,Don't Shake！今天也謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:38.47,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,來吧來吧 再來一球如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:41.35,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,你也來吧 來到棒球場
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.35,0:23:43.33,OPEDCHJP,,0,0,0,,一定能在這裡抓住夢想！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.82,0:01:33.99,title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)}都是風惹的禍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,摩托車太陽球場 有個露天球場特有的名產
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.41,0:01:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,比賽中有時會颳起強風
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&H222221&\fad(233,1)\fscx99\fscy97\pos(1540.5,27)}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF1F0EE&\pos(1218,42)\fad(233,1)}守備位置 {\c&H2C27A8&}| {\c&HF1F0EE&}打擊率 {\c&H2C27A8&}| {\c&HF1F0EE&}HR\N\N{\fs48}６ 獅子尾\N８ 矢木野\N７ 鋸山\N５ 楊\NDH 布萊恩\N３ 高田\N９ 小次郎\N４ 一宮\N２ 川松\NＰ 三井
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF1F0EE&\pos(1566,150.75)\fad(233,1)}{\fs48}.311\N.278\N.321\N.271\N.295\N.258\N.265\N.205\N.235
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HF1F0EE&\pos(1815,150.75)\fad(233,1)}{\fs48}8\N0\N9\N28\N25\N13\N17\N0\N5
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz2.576\shad0\c&HF6F8D2&l\fs60\move(739.5,1056,739.5,348,0,2978)}風速
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,風勢對比賽的走向有很大的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,兩人出局 跑者分佔一二壘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,三井投手 球數兩好球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,投出！打者揮棒！打到球了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,飛往三壘界外區！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要進觀眾席了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不對！風把球吹回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,接…接到球了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,游擊手獅子尾的美技守備！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這球追得辛苦 更別提是在全壘打牆邊了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,守得漂亮對吧 球評栗原先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 他確實把風勢也考慮進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,獅子尾！你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,多謝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小事一樁！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不過別太勉強 小心受傷喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,與其說教 不如專心投球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是為了紀紗學姊拚盡全力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這種守備根本小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你少打我馬子主意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,別跟學長沒大沒小
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,三局下半
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,摩托車太陽隊進攻 首先上場的是七棒右外野手小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,風勢是往右吹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,左打者比較有利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.47,0:02:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,這種情況下最好把球拉到右半邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,投手是逆風投球 應該投不出什麼快速球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,應該會投變化球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你看著吧 Sun四郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\c&H0D0D17&\3c&HCDD4D5&\shad0\fad(231,1)\fs36\pos(279,321)\frz2.842}站姿再高一點！\N右肘抬高！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,風勢對觀眾席也有影響
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,來了 大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,您的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 謝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天換了倒酒的方式喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你們有發現嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,味道跟平常一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,當然是美味啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣不行喔 大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,還自稱是我的粉絲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,掰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,喂！你不解釋一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我們什麼時候變你粉絲了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,瑠璃子妹妹總是很有活力耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,來了 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就在這時 一陣強風吹過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\shad0\c&HF6F8D2&\fs105\frz3.841\pos(1755,39)}風速
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了 超厲害的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,果然還是要來現場 才有這種感動對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,多虧了這陣風！太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大哥你根本是個小學生嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看到我的內褲就那麼興奮嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜我裡面穿了安全褲 根本什麼都看不到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要再看一次嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下！你在幹嘛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.81,0:04:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,事到如今才害羞也太慢了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你到底在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,還能是什麼？就是風把我的裙子…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是說全壘打…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎選手擊出首打席陽春砲！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,乘著風勢的完美一擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛好站在我前面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我還以為你是擔心自己擋到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 原來是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,身為男人竟然只顧著看全壘打 你的男子氣概在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抱…抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒來了 七百日圓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.59,0:05:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我有叫啤酒嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 沒差
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？今天的啤酒泡是不是比較少啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是為了不讓啤酒泡被風吹走對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的沒看到嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…那個…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹嘛道歉啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不過你竟然注意到啤酒泡了 真不賴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 他沒看到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙真是遲鈍到不行耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不過他竟然注意到啤酒泡了 真令人開心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有白費工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,廢話 我當然看到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那種角度怎麼可能看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好我情急之下掰的藉口她信了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎 感謝你的全壘打
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:07:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,風勢對整個球場都有著重大的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:06.07,title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)}標記
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,今年的選秀很精彩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 真是大豐…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 剛才那三個女的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,超正的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次休假來看球耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:20.00,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FAF1&\fad(355,1)\pos(270,387)}瑠璃子\N首次以觀眾身分看球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好興奮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,瑠璃子你的打扮也太拚了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:23.46,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FAF1&\fad(355,1)\pos(189,408)}心\N第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我會好好教你們享受比賽的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:27.93,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FAF1&\fad(355,1)\pos(183,390)}青奈\N第十一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了！拜託你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,包在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,辣妹、清純型、偶像型…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這三人是什麼組合啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 青奈學姊 那條毛巾哪裡買的啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒妹們偶爾也會在休假時
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}別急啦 商品店裡有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,自己跑來球場看球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}那我們買同款的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我們順便去休息室打個招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？你們三個今天不是休假嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是來看球的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,這個是伴手禮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是來視察大家有沒有認真工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你這觀眾還真囂張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 觀眾請退場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡可是員工專用區喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,慢走不送
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…咦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,三井投手為什麼突然投球到一壘啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那是牽制球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,避免跑者輕易起跑的動作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,三井投手的牽制技術可是很有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,請問要Hyper Dry啤酒嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 大家都在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是紗良耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,來得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要三杯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:08:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,機會難得 我們拿著啤酒拍張照吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:08:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 我來幫你們拍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不用客氣 你也一起入鏡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦 我還在上班耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,來 大家一起喊「夕日啤酒最棒了」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我先去一下洗手間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到休假來看球也這麼好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,最近來看球的年輕女生變多了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她是在來回踱步嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我做錯什麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼會有辣妹坐在我旁邊啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺是個很麻煩的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你是哪位啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瑠…瑠璃子？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,咦…咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0D1712&\fad(351,1)\3c&HFEFFFD&\pos(1683,27)}幾天後
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,瑠…瑠璃子？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,對啦 我就是瑠璃子 怎樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那天真是謝謝你了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我說大哥你啊 你真的很過分耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然沒認出我來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,虧你還是我的常客
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因…因為你沒穿制服嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,還戴了太陽眼鏡…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,反正對你來說 啤酒妹都長一個樣吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真是差勁透了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.53,0:11:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不是那樣的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是沒有名牌或標記 就認不出女生啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,男人就是這點討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…那個…我想我應該是搞錯了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.53,0:11:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你頭上的花飾…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那個算是標記嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你最近才開始戴的 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…不…我果然還是搞錯了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,被發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那個…很適合你喔 真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,別想這樣就蒙混過去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小哥你真是沒血沒淚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,沒血沒淚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.04,0:12:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,既視感
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:19.43,title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)}小心網路新聞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,某天 員工休息室一如往常
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但當時還沒有人察覺即將逼近的黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你昨天有看P聯盟TV嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,當然有看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那個用打擊聲做成的「祭典音樂」超好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}X等於…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,幹嘛找瑠璃子學姊教我暑假作業 我是笨蛋嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我想想喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}嗯…這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可是現在青奈學姊好像很忙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\shad0\c&HFFFDFA&\3c&HA97949&}千葉縣 論說文與面試\N{\c&H1B201D&\3c&HEDEDEE&}歷屆考題
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,教師資格考的面試是後天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我都還沒想好要說什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,青奈 你有空嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,這位是飯島記者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他今天來採訪啤酒妹的工作情形
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,請…請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,青奈 你帶他在觀眾席 待一個小時左右好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？要我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好的…可是我有點緊張…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不用緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能盡量表現得自然一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,媽 我不是說過不用打電話叫我起床了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,還有 老家寄來的葡萄也夠了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂～飯島小弟嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我是喧囂網的主編 大竹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是！辛苦您了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:14:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,飯島小弟啊 你上次的報導點閱率又不怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊 身為專業人士 要寫出能賺錢的報導才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,非…非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,下…下次我一定會…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我想說給你一個標題好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.08,0:14:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「男性至上、利益至上」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「啤酒妹的強制勞動」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就寫這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒妹的強制勞動？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,像是如果賣不好就會被欺負之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,或者表面上笑嘻嘻 其實都在背後說客人壞話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,總之寫一些能衝高點閱率的內容
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,辦得到吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我會努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒妹的工作很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,其實還滿能鍛鍊身體的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要是賣不好 就會被減少排班對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,休息室裡的氣氛一定很緊繃吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是利益至上不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,想必很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,公司當然會希望我們業績好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不過氣氛一點都不緊繃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不會
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.13,0:15:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,走著瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對了 就像牛棚一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,牛棚？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好球！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,七海！下一局你上場！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.37,title,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord5\c&HFDFDFD&\fad(395,1)\pos(912,63)}那波浩志（27歲）\N{\fs48}第五年 最快球速157km 右投手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說你直接跟總教練要求 今天讓你上場投球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經兩個月沒在一軍出賽 都沒拿到勝投了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我很任性
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.52,0:15:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我…我還…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,別說那種話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,棒球不是只看成績的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:15:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在只要想著好好投球就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:16:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,把氣勢拉回來啊 七海
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,中繼投手就是要展現氣魄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就像牛棚的投手們會互相打氣一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我們休息室也是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很有團隊精神喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,團隊精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那客人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一定也有討厭的客人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.38,0:16:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一直陪笑臉不是很累嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你看那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,麻煩給我一杯啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您的再度光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,為了高潮系列賽 要好好補充能量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因為是第一次要打進高潮系列賽 所以大家都情緒高漲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,根本沒空陪笑臉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是那個意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.23,0:16:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱…抱歉 我接個電話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,飯島小弟！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:16:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,主…主編？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那篇報導進行得如何啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是的 我正在採訪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好好幹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 你在接受採訪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是採訪達人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,還上過《週刊棒球》呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,儘管問我問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙肯定會爆料
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要讓客人買啤酒很辛苦吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你們一定會用那個技巧對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,技巧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,銷售的五句「真」言！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(418.5,66)\fscx91\fscy106}m 0 0 l 690 0 l 690 645 l 0 645
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\an7\c&H624DE2&\bord9\shad0\pos(120,78)\3c&H000000&} 真 {\fs70\c&H000301&\3c&HFEFFFF&\bord6}不愧是您～
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&}我{\fs100\an7\c&H624DE2&\bord9\shad0\pos(120,216)} 真 {\fs70\c&H000301&\3c&HFEFFFF&\bord6}的不知道～
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&}您{\fs100\an7\c&H624DE2&\bord9\shad0\pos(120,351)} 真 {\fs70\c&H000301&\3c&HFEFFFF&\bord6}厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&}您{\fs100\an7\c&H624DE2&\bord9\shad0\pos(120,486)} 真 {\fs70\c&H000301&\3c&HFEFFFF&\bord6}有品味～
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&}您{\fs100\an7\c&H624DE2&\bord9\shad0\pos(120,615)} 真 {\fs70\c&H000301&\3c&HFEFFFF&\bord6}聰明～
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,五句真言？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我知道那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.45,0:17:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,反正客人們都只是待宰羔羊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:47.50,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\\c&H00FAF1&\pos(777,564)\fad(1,143)}倒出完美的啤酒！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:52.26,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FAF1&\fad(144,189)\pos(895.5,813)}不知道客人在說什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,野手選擇？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.81,0:17:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不知道呢～要多學學才行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:57.51,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FAF1&\fad(149,184)\pos(975,519)}因為充滿活力而受到稱讚！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,瑠璃子妹妹的待客之道真棒啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.21,0:17:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我真厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:18:01.43,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FAF1&\fad(184,184)\pos(837,738)}今天選的花飾很可愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真有品味！我好會選！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:06.06,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FAF1&\fad(185,1)\pos(798,741)}發現自己未知的優點！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你的聲音真好聽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣啊～我真了不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,這是辣妹的五句真言嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,自我肯定感也太強了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(312,1)\fs90\pos(1599,126)\shad6\c&H858386&\4c&H636161&\3c&H545248&}沮喪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你採訪到需要的內容了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,職棒不過是種娛樂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,啤酒賣不賣得掉 能不能賺錢才是重點
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛才說的那些不過是場面話吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是場面話 我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不過球迷們是因為喜歡棒球才來球場
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,球員們是因為想贏球才站上球場
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是因為喜歡這份工作才在這裡工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都是因為各自的理由才聚在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,除此之外還需要其他理由嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:19:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你總是只看得到人好的一面是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上並不是只有像你說的那種好人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣啊 我或許…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,其實啊 我想當老師
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是 主編嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦您了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.23,0:19:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,阿正？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,媽…媽？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉喔 早上沒打電話給你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你有自己起床嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是說過不用打電話叫我起床了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天寄了很多葡萄過去喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你聽我說話好不好！ 我不是說過我吃不完那麼多嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我們這裡每天都很熱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你要小心別感冒了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,阿正 我都有看你寫的報導喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用看那種東西啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.15,0:20:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可是寫得很好看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,每次都讓我很感動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我會一直支持你的 你要繼續加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,媽…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我要掛了喔 我還在忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.05,0:20:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,最後以時速158公里的快速球作結！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,七海投手投出三局無失分！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.96,title,,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\frz2.606\c&HFFFEF9&\3c&HB57A52&\pos(594,600)}帶我們進高潮系列賽！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,長中繼投手為球隊注入了活力！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都是因為各自的理由才聚在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,喂～飯島小弟！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 主編
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.57,0:21:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\c&H5B5D5D&\3c&HEEF1EF&}啤酒妹的{\s1}強制{\s0}互相幫助勞動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我下次一定會寫出好報導…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可以請您聽聽我的企劃嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本還擔心自己當不成好老師…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.53,0:21:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你總是只看得到人好的一面是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 P聯盟TV又有新影片了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 紗良 你這裡寫錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在正在給青奈學姊教 不要來亂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,下次去唱卡拉OK吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.05,0:21:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,唉唷 全身痠痛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,推薦你去三溫暖喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.78,0:21:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我也常常自己去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想打造出這種氣氛的班級
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.76,0:21:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果教師資格考順利通過 我大概就要從啤酒妹畢業了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.94,0:21:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,青奈學姊 你怎麼啦？在發呆喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你在煩惱什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有啦 我只是覺得能遇到這麼好的後輩真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.89,0:22:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你這樣說我會害羞啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.03,0:22:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,出現了！辣妹的五句真言！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.53,0:22:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,紗良 你也想當辣妹嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,為…為什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我永遠都看不膩耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:50.31,next,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1656,684)}「湯米的憂鬱」 \N\N「村田先生」\N\N「Show Your Sun」
